{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Club Valley is a 2D open-world Chess RPG\u2014</strong>An epic adventure where every showdown is settled in chess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam an action-packed overworld packed with characters, monsters, and hidden secrets waiting off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dangerous underworld dungeons and face Super Bosses in high-stakes chess battles. Along the way, meet engaging characters with distinct personalities, challenge them to matches, and level up your XP as you grow stronger for what\u2019s ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With charming pixel art, 8/16-bit inspired music, and 20+ hours of gameplay, Chess Club Valley delivers a full quest you can explore at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2D open-world Chess RPG adventure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an action-packed overworld filled with characters, monsters, and secrets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter underworld dungeons and battle Super Bosses in chess</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talk to personality-filled characters and challenge them to level up XP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming pixel art visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8/16-bit inspired music</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ hours of gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad Support</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2498830?t=1770996664","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498830/d77ab460e35d73027cacee442